					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-458709#post-4096775</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-458709/follow-the-keter#post-4096775</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 23 Dec 2018 09:04:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Saw the above in Recent Posts, thought&#8230; well. It's late, I'm tired, and my New Year's Resolution was to try and burn myself out less and try to do fun spontaneous things more.</p> <p>&#8212;-</p> <p>Zyn it to win it, watch me begin it<br /> The highest-volume critter, no matter how you spin it<br /> Write villanelles, what the hell, sending PMs or a .tell<br /> Inbox flooded hours on end, never had an easy spell</p> <p>I've always got eyes in the night, Recent Posts are in my sight<br /> Calling out the problem posts and making sure reviews are right<br /> Butterfly Squad represent, callsigns proud and effort spent<br /> Face the fires every day, every draft is an event</p> <p>Six years' past since I arrived, emotion in each skip I make<br /> Bring the tears with 348, then contemplate in the wake<br /> Of 26 and counting on, co-authoring has been my song<br /> I'll school you in the science tone, teach you right techniques from wrong</p> <p>Clinical, professional, I've been there IRL you know<br /> Thrifty language, pretty prose, that is what I've got to show<br /> It's tough sometimes day in, day out, never boring never easy<br /> But I'm the Adzynistrator, *<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-42621-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> don't fucking mess with me.</p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-42621-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. insert your one-syllable swear word of choice.</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
